OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,FA fire damaged school in the Borders
OL,8,Fwill remain closed when the new term
OL,9,Fstarts in two weeks time, as pupils
OL,10,Fare relocated.
OL,12,FA blaze broke out at Newtown Primary
OL,13,FSchool on Saturday 25 July. A teenage
OL,14,Fboy has been charged in connection
OL,15,Fwith the incident.
OL,17,FScottish Borders Council say work is
OL,18,Funderway to repair the damage caused
OL,19,Fbut it is not yet known when the site
OL,20,Fwill reopen - although it could be
OL,21,Fmonths.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,327,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,FAround 100 children will be affected
OL,8,Fby the ongoing closure and many will
OL,9,Fface a 9-mile round trip from 19th
OL,10,FAugust.
OL,12,FNursery children are being offered
OL,13,Fspace in Earlston, whilst the nearby
OL,14,Fcouncil headquarters building will be
OL,15,Fadapted to accommodate the 80 or so
OL,16,Fschool pupils.
OL,18,FOne parent told us that her son's
OL,19,Fexcitement for his first day of school
OL,20,Fhas turned to dread.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,327,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,F"He was looking forward to going into
OL,8,Fprimary one but now that I've made him
OL,9,Faware that he's not going to be going
OL,10,Finto primary one at Newtown, he's
OL,11,Fpoint blank refused wanting to go
OL,12,Fnow," said Lara Rice.
OL,14,F"It is a huge adjustment for them,
OL,15,Fhe's going into a building that he's
OL,16,Fnever been in before and for a little
OL,17,Fchild to look at from outside it's
OL,18,Fhuge. And I just feel like it's taken
OL,19,Faway his first day of school."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,327,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,FLara also said she considered keeping
OL,8,Fher younger son, aged 3, from starting
OL,9,Fnursery until things were back to
OL,10,Fnormal to save him the upheaval too,
OL,11,Fbut doesn't want him to miss out on
OL,12,Ftime with other kids.
OL,14,FScottish Borders Council have invited
OL,15,Fparents to meetings later this week to
OL,16,Fdiscuss the temporary arrangements and
OL,17,Fraise any concerns.JThese will be at
OL,18,FCouncil HQ:
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,327,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,FCouncillor Leagh Douglas said she
OL,8,Funderstood, and also shared, the
OL,9,Fdisappointment felt by the parents.
OL,11,F"We just have to rally together and
OL,12,Flook for the best solution," she said.
OL,14,F"Officers have been working very hard
OL,15,Fon finding the optimal solution for
OL,16,Fthese young people and now we're
OL,17,Finviting the parents in to listen to
OL,18,Ftheir thoughts and concerns, and
OL,19,Fofficers will be there to offer
OL,20,Freassurance.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,327,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,F"What we do with certainty is it's not
OL,8,Ftwo, three weeks - we are talking
OL,9,Fmonths but hopefully not too many
OL,10,Fmonths at all and we are quite
OL,11,Foptimistic with the estimates that
OL,12,Fhave come in there, we're working with
OL,13,Fprofessionals who know how to deal
OL,14,Fwith these situations so it's
OL,15,Fhopefully not too long. But long
OL,16,Fenough that we need sound, alternative
OL,17,Fplans."
OL,19,FScottish Borders Council said its
OL,20,Fpriority has been ensuring children
OL,21,Fcan return to learning.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,327,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,F"Following the fire, our priority has
OL,8,Fbeen ensuring children can return to
OL,9,Flearning in a safe, secure and
OL,10,Fwelcoming learning environment," a
OL,11,Fspokesperson said.
OL,13,F"The damage to the school extends
OL,14,Fthrough the building and extensive
OL,15,Fwork is underway to restore the
OL,16,Fbuilding. Comprehensive temporary
OL,17,Farrangements have been put in place so
OL,18,Feducation can continue with as little
OL,19,Fdisruption as possible.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,327,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786106903
OL,3,CFire damaged Borders school won't
OL,4,Creopen when term starts as pupils
OL,5,Crelocated
OL,7,F"We've considered the requirements to
OL,8,Foperate a nursery and school as well
OL,9,Fas providing support such as transport
OL,10,Ffor parents and children.
OL,12,F"We're grateful to parents, staff and
OL,13,Fthe wider community for their
OL,14,Fpatience, support and understanding
OL,15,Fthroughout this challenging time."
OL,26,@tD@AOU
